    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Self-screening for the coronavirus continues to be a public health priority in every country around the world. To support government efforts to reduce the spread of the disease, the Aga Khan University and Hospital have launched CoronaCheck, a new mobile app that enables Pakistanis to easily and safely evaluate symptoms with an in-home screening tool and understand the next steps to looking after themselves.",
